{title: Bhay Ithle Sampat Nahi}
{artist: Lata Mangeshkar Hridaynath Mangeskhar}
{key: C#}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#] [G#] [C#],        Bhay ithale sampat nahi
[C#] [Fm] [A#m] [C#],        maj tuzi atwan yete
[C#] [G#] [C#],        me sandhykali gato
[C#] [Fm] [A#m] [C#],        tu mala shikawali geete
[C#] [G#] [C#],        te zare chndra sajnache
[D#] [Fm] [C#],        ti dharati bhgavi maya
[C#] [D#] [C#],        zadashi nijalo apan zadat punha ugwaya
